From 0d40ec863d7a7e67b8668de5970dbfabb3b6c5b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:08:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Add a phase timing harness and cumulative measurements

Add an ignored test, src/breakdown.rs, that times decode, evaluate and
encode phases of full and lean calls, matrix calls and worker scaling
on the examples/performance.rs workloads. Record its output and the
0.2.0-to-round-10 paired timings under evidence/performance-0.3.0/.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
